<section>
  <h2>Locating Contacts and Identifying Forces</h2>
  <p>
    MCP-EP estimates contact positions and forces from joint torque sensors and a force/torque sensor at the robot base. The base measurement adds six
    sensing degrees of freedom, helping distinguish contacts that joint torque measurements alone cannot identify, particularly on links near the
    base. The method supports several simultaneous contacts without a tactile skin.
  </p>
