  <h3>Exploration Across Links</h3>
  <p>
    Distances between different links change as the robot moves and cannot use the same fixed lookup. Exploration particles search adjacent links,
    allowing the estimate to move away from an incorrect link. Particle sets are added or removed when the current contact hypotheses no longer
    explain the sensor measurements, or when a set becomes unnecessary.
  </p>
