</section>

<section>
  <h2>Simulation Validation</h2>
  <p>
    Each contact condition was evaluated in 10,000 randomized trials using a seven-degree-of-freedom Franka Emika Panda in MuJoCo. A 20 N force was
    applied at each sampled contact, with at most one contact per link. Success means localization error no greater than 2.25 cm. The reported RMSE
    values include failed trials.
  </p>
